    <briefdescription>
<para>SAE J2012 / ISO 15031-6 UDS Diagnostic Trouble Code (DTC) Utilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides standalone, zero-heap conversion functions between human-readable SAE J2012 DTC strings (e.g., &quot;P010500&quot;, &quot;B111717&quot;, &quot;U013100&quot;) and 24-bit UDS wire integers (e.g., 0x010500, 0x911717, 0xC13100). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
